msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm home......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya llegué......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I gotta do something about the＿bloodstains...... Gotta hurry and take off＿these clothes......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Tengo que hacer algo con las manchas＿de sangre...... Debo darme prisa y＿quitarme esta ropa......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yasuko! I'm gonna use ammonia, so it＿might start to reek. Pinch your nose＿with a towel.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Yasuko! Voy a usar amoníaco, así＿que puede empezar a apestar. Tápate＿la nariz con una toalla.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hm? Yasuko's not here?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Mm? ¿Yasuko no está?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......She doesn't have to be at work yet＿though.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Aunque todavía no tiene＿que estar en el trabajo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yasuko? Taking a bath? On the toilet?＿Or...... Whoa!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Yasuko? ¿Tomando un baño? ¿En＿el inodoro? O...... ¡Uah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Owwww...... Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ayyyy...... ¡Taiga!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't look! It's not like I took it off for＿fun! And don't start attacking my little＿nipples either!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No mires! ¡No es que me la quitara＿por gusto! ¡Y tampoco te pongas a＿atacar mis pobres pezones!」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Taiga? Are you listening?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Taiga? ¿Me estás escuchando?」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm thinking. Don't talk to me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estoy pensando. No me hables.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did you not consider doing the＿thinking in your own house?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No consideraste ponerte a＿pensar en tu propia casa?」"

msgid "Taiga「Be quiet.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cállate.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You little...... Oh, come to think of it,＿have you seen Yasuko?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mocosa...... Ah, ahora que lo＿pienso, ¿has visto a Yasuko?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yacchan already left.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yacchan ya se fue.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Already? Isn't it kinda early? She＿doesn't start work until later.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ya? ¿No es algo temprano? No entra＿a trabajar hasta más tarde.」"

msgid "Taiga「She said today would be busy with＿preparations for the New Year's party.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Dijo que hoy estaría ocupada＿con los preparativos para la＿fiesta de Año Nuevo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. She didn't tell me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. No me dijo nada.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yacchan said it's an annual event. Well,＿I'm sure you forgot that in the first＿place.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yacchan dijo que es un evento＿anual. Bueno, seguro que de todas＿formas lo olvidaste.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué......」"

msgid "Taiga「The world keeps turning, round and＿round. But not for the stupid dog that＿got left behind.」"
msgstr "Taiga「El mundo sigue girando y girando.＿Pero no para el perro tonto＿que se quedó atrás.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, I didn't ask to be left behind.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, yo no pedí quedarme atrás.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Jum.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I wanted to tell her about my talk with＿Kawashima, but...... now's not the time.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Quería contarle sobre mi charla＿con Kawashima, pero...... no＿es el momento.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Anyway, take off that citrusy coat.＿That's the top priority right now. Oh,＿and one more thing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En fin, quítate ese abrigo con olor＿a cítricos. Es la mayor prioridad ahora＿mismo. Ah, y una cosa más.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I've been meaning to give this to you＿all day.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Llevo todo el día queriendo darte esto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Th-That......!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡E-Eso......!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This is a mystery bag from＿Kanou-Mart, isn't it? You woke up＿early today in order to get it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es una bolsa sorpresa de Kanou-Mart,＿¿verdad? Hoy te despertaste temprano＿para conseguirla.」"

msgid "Taiga「G-Give it back! Give it, give it, GIVE IT!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡D-Devuélvemela! ¡Dámela,＿dámela, DÁMELA!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I am! I was carrying this around for＿you!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Eso hago! ¡La estuve cargando por ti!」"

msgid "Taiga「Did you...... l-l-l-l-l-look inside......?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Tú...... m-m-m-m-m-miraste＿dentro......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I didn't \"look\" so much as you pelted＿various things at me in the younger＿Kanou sister's room.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es que \"mirara\", más bien me lanzaste＿varias cosas en el cuarto de la hermana＿menor de Kanou.」"

msgid "Taiga「You didn't see anything else!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿No viste nada más?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nope. I just put stuff back in.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No. Solo volví a meter todo adentro.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's fine then.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entonces está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So why were you so desperate for a＿Kanou-Mart mystery bag?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y por qué estabas tan desesperada por＿una bolsa sorpresa de Kanou-Mart?」"

msgid "Taiga「............I'm giving it to you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「............Te la doy.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「What? You look like you were just shot＿with a BB gun. Be happier about it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué? Parece que te dispararon con una＿pistola de balines. ¡Alégrate más!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga...... don't tell me, you really got up＿early just for my sake?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga...... ¿no me digas que de verdad＿te levantaste temprano solo por mí?」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You waited in that huge line, fought＿with Tomiie Kota, and even got juice＿poured on you, all for my sake......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hiciste esa fila enorme, peleaste＿con Tomiie Kota y hasta te echaron＿jugo encima, todo por mí......?」"

msgid "Taiga「It's fine if you don't want it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Si no la quieres, da igual!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I-I, I do, I do!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡S-Sí, sí la quiero, sí la quiero!」"

msgid "Taiga「You can thank me by making some＿tasty food.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Puedes agradecérmelo preparando＿algo rico de comer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... Sure! Leave it to me!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... ¡Claro! ¡Déjamelo a mí!」"

msgid "Taiga「H-O-W-E-V-E-R! For now, let me take＿this home today.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡S-I-N E-M-B-A-R-G-O! Por ahora, déjame＿llevarme esto a casa hoy.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Why? It's heavy, so just put it＿down somewhere.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Por qué? Pesa mucho, así＿que déjala en algún lado.」"

msgid "Taiga「Absolutely not.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ni hablar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now you lost me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya no te entiendo.」"

msgid "Taiga「A-A girl's mind is complex. Listen, I＿swear to God I'll give you the contents,＿so don't ask any more questions!」"
msgstr "Taiga「L-La mente de una chica es compleja.＿¡Oye, te juro por Dios que te daré el＿contenido, así que no preguntes más!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......It'll happen. Any moment now.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Va a pasar en cualquier momento.）」"

msgid "Taiga「S-See ya! I'll come back later!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡N-Nos vemos! ¡Vuelvo más tarde!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I know all too well. Whenever she's＿unsettled, it'll happen without fail!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Lo sé demasiado bien. ¡Siempre que＿está nerviosa, pasa sin falta!）」"

msgid "Taiga「I'll come back in time for dinner!＿......Aaah!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Volveré a tiempo para la＿cena! ......¡¡Aaah!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Behold!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Contempla!」"

msgid "Taiga「Th-That hurt......」"
msgstr "Taiga「E-Eso dolió......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're way too predictable. Sheesh......＿Aww, the canned crab is dented!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eres demasiado predecible. Cielos......＿¡Ay, la lata de cangrejo se abolló!」"

msgid "Taiga「Th-That's--!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡E-Eso es--!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Overnight Breast Enhancement＿Supplement\"......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Suplemento para aumentar el＿pecho en una noche\"......?」"

msgid "Taiga「AAAAAAAAAAHHHH!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡AAAAAAAAAAHHHH!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, don't tell me......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, no me digas que......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Now I get it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ahora lo entiendo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Calm down, Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cálmate, Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey! Taiga! Take that off!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oye! ¡Taiga! ¡Quítate eso!」"

msgid "Taiga「Be quiet, raisins!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Cállate, pasas!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（R-Raisins...... again......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡P-Pasas...... otra vez......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I wasn't really going to comment on the＿supplement...... and I failed to tell her＿about Kawashima.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（En realidad no iba a decir nada＿del suplemento...... y no alcancé＿a contarle lo de Kawashima.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......She's going to bring back that spice＿set, right?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Sí va a traer de vuelta ese＿set de especias, ¿verdad?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Aww, the blood's completely dried. No＿choice but to soak it in bleach and＿ammonia before washing......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ay, la sangre se secó por completo.＿Habrá que remojarla en blanqueador y＿amoníaco antes de lavarla......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（And even then it might not come out＿completely.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Y aun así puede que no＿salga por completo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Furthermore, in this stain removal＿assault, there's still the pitfall of＿discoloration to worry about......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Además, en esta ofensiva contra las＿manchas, aún debo cuidarme del peligro＿de que la ropa se decolore......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（But I'll succeed. In this battle, I'll surely＿be the proven victor!!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Pero lo lograré. ¡En esta batalla,＿sin duda saldré victorioso!!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「F-For now, it's dangerous to stand＿around here. Oh, you haven't changed＿clothes!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Por ahora, es peligroso quedarse＿de pie aquí. ¡Ah, no te has＿cambiado de ropa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Take off that coat right now so I can＿wash it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Quítate ese abrigo ahora mismo＿para que pueda lavarlo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, this is Gourmet Pavilion's golden＿spice set! I would expect no less from＿Kanou-Mart!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Oh, este es el set dorado de＿especias de Gourmet Pavilion! ¡No＿esperaba menos de Kanou-Mart!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Jeez, I've done nothing but pick＿stuff up all day. Oh, what's this?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Cielos, no he hecho más＿que recoger cosas todo el día.＿¿Eh, qué es esto?」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up, shut up, SHUT UP! It's always＿sold out in stores and through＿mail-order!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate, cállate, CÁLLATE!＿¡Siempre está agotado en tiendas＿y por pedido postal!」"

msgid "Taiga「And it was the featured product in this＿year's Kanou-Mart mystery bag!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Y era el producto estrella en la bolsa＿sorpresa de Kanou-Mart de este año!」"

msgid "Taiga「What's that look for?! Hmph. I bet＿you're thinking that a cutting-board＿chest shouldn't bother trying!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué es esa mirada?! Jum. ¡Seguro estás＿pensando que un pecho de tabla de picar＿ni debería intentarlo!」"

msgid "Taiga「Even cutting boards yearn for chicken＿cutlets!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Hasta las tablas de picar anhelan＿chuletas de pollo!」"

msgid "Taiga「I even have to put breast pads in my＿clothes. When I imagine my future, fear＿slowly creeps into me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Hasta tengo que ponerme relleno en la＿ropa. Cuando imagino mi futuro, el miedo＿se apodera poco a poco de mí.」"

msgid "Taiga「As if you could understand how I feel!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Como si entendieras cómo me siento!!」"
